1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:04,133
Oh, see? It's so beautiful.

2
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:05,567
You look so fresh now.

3
00:00:05,567 --> 00:00:07,567
You don't look
like a maid of honor.

4
00:00:08,733 --> 00:00:12,100
[HANNAH]<i> Is Kpaps going to
</i> sell me to foreigners?

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,700
<i>I mean, what kind
of translator...</i>

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,967
<i> is this pretty?</i>

7
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,167
Pose. Go, keep going.

8
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:22,533
[RIA] So pretty! Very fresh!

9
00:00:22,533 --> 00:00:24,967
She's so pretty. Yes!

10
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:29,200
Pose! Yes!
What a beautiful lady!

11
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,200
[GRUNTS]

12
00:00:32,467 --> 00:00:33,667
Oh.

13
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,400
You look pretty...

14
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:39,200
for someone who scrubs floors.

15
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,167
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

16
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:43,600
Oh, Madam.

17
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,767
I don't want
to fight today, okay?

18
00:00:45,767 --> 00:00:48,233
First of all, Daniel's not here.

19
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:49,467
And secondly,

20
00:00:49,467 --> 00:00:50,800
I'm too pretty today.

21
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,067
[CHUCKLES DRYLY]

22
00:00:52,067 --> 00:00:53,333
Fight?

23
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:54,467
No!

24
00:00:55,133 --> 00:00:57,467
- I'm here to do laundry!
- Hey! Hey!

25
00:00:57,467 --> 00:00:59,600
- [RIA] Miss... Hey!
- [HANNAH SCREAMING]

26
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,533
Stop it! Hey!

27
00:01:01,533 --> 00:01:04,100
- Hey!
- Funny thing about laundry...

28
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:07,533
- Some stains...
- [HANNAH COUGHS]

29
00:01:07,567 --> 00:01:09,367
- ...never leave!
- Stop--

30
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,633
[RIA] Stop! Brenda!

31
00:01:12,633 --> 00:01:14,667
- [BRENDA LAUGHING]
- [HANNAH COUGHING]

32
00:01:14,667 --> 00:01:16,567
You like that, huh?

33
00:01:17,267 --> 00:01:18,500
Oh, you want to do this, huh?

34
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,633
[BRENDA SCREAMING]

35
00:01:20,633 --> 00:01:23,300
[SCREAMS] Aah!

36
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:26,233
Do you hear the words
coming out of your mouth?!

37
00:01:26,633 --> 00:01:28,400
You need to freshen up!

38
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:31,300
- [SCREAMS]
- Wash off that personality!

39
00:01:33,467 --> 00:01:36,200
If I weren't in heels,
I swear...

40
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:39,333
You stay away from Daniel!

41
00:01:39,333 --> 00:01:40,667
He's mine!

42
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:42,400
Fine!

43
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,567
Then you can have him
for all I care!

44
00:01:46,567 --> 00:01:47,833
[BRENDA SCREAMS]

45
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,100
[MUFFLED SCREAMING]

46
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:53,367
[HUFFING]

47
00:01:55,133 --> 00:01:57,533
- [GRUNTS]
- [RIA SCREAMS]

48
00:02:00,633 --> 00:02:02,233
What are you doing?

49
00:02:02,233 --> 00:02:03,467
[BRENDA SCREAMS]

50
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,233
I didn't do anything.

51
00:02:06,233 --> 00:02:10,233
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]
